    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/35b51e3f46bc288ceb500203ffdec532.avif?t=1753477152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a relentless quest to reclaim the wilds. Dinosaurs Dominion is built around <strong>action based combat</strong>, <strong>story driven exploration</strong>, and <strong>layered progression</strong>.\u00a0Inspired by roguelite design, each journey is self-contained where progress is earned through both exploration and conquest,\u00a0while lasting impacts carry over between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/37482c3be9e358b4d843e62b0272f4ef.avif?t=1753477152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.poster.avif?t=1753477152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.webm?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.mp4?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off in personal, <strong>high-stakes</strong>, <strong>one\u00a0on\u00a0one combat</strong>, a test of timing, spacing, and skill.\u00a0Every fight rewards patience, punishes recklessness, and demands vigilance as you wait for your moment to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/e13322d9440079dd9a0f6c4f1467706e.avif?t=1753477152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/2e389ccb90c9f91d4c750c7386325a32.poster.avif?t=1753477152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/2e389ccb90c9f91d4c750c7386325a32.webm?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/2e389ccb90c9f91d4c750c7386325a32.mp4?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roam freely across <strong>diverse biomes</strong>. From\u00a0lush forests to ashen\u00a0wastes and snow covered cliffs.\u00a0Uncover secrets, discover ancient landmarks, and unlock new species along the way.\u00a0Each region tells\u00a0its own story, and every step brings you closer to reclaiming the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/6ef85795ca4f6008c2c7cd8f4a94e9c6.avif?t=1753477152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/cadee757bbe83994fd5e13283010fee0.poster.avif?t=1753477152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/cadee757bbe83994fd5e13283010fee0.webm?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/cadee757bbe83994fd5e13283010fee0.mp4?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock mutations</strong> that suit your playstyle and sharpen your instincts with each victory,\u00a0while defeat returns you to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/506cf160148ac709a5576a6b2ad9cf05.avif?t=1753477152\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>14 playable dinosaurs</strong>, from nimble scouts to towering juggernauts, each with a playstyle defined by size, power, and mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>13 mutations</strong> that let you evolve, specialize, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 open-world maps</strong>, each with unique biomes and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focused <strong>one on one combat</strong> inspired by Souls-like design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite progression</strong>\u00a0with\u00a0single-run challenges and\u00a0permanent impact across journeys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Landmarks</strong>, Relics, and Echoes that reward exploration with meaningful discoveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Totems and Trophies</strong>,\u00a0unlockable rewards that reveal deeper insights into the world.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/35b51e3f46bc288ceb500203ffdec532.avif?t=1753477152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a relentless quest to reclaim the wilds. Dinosaurs Dominion is built around <strong>action based combat</strong>, <strong>story driven exploration</strong>, and <strong>layered progression</strong>.\u00a0Inspired by roguelite design, each journey is self-contained where progress is earned through both exploration and conquest,\u00a0while lasting impacts carry over between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/37482c3be9e358b4d843e62b0272f4ef.avif?t=1753477152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.poster.avif?t=1753477152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.webm?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/0b6768a761d1b1902e0fd74bd9e910e0.mp4?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off in personal, <strong>high-stakes</strong>, <strong>one\u00a0on\u00a0one combat</strong>, a test of timing, spacing, and skill.\u00a0Every fight rewards patience, punishes recklessness, and demands vigilance as you wait for your moment to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/e13322d9440079dd9a0f6c4f1467706e.avif?t=1753477152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/2e389ccb90c9f91d4c750c7386325a32.poster.avif?t=1753477152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/2e389ccb90c9f91d4c750c7386325a32.webm?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/2e389ccb90c9f91d4c750c7386325a32.mp4?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roam freely across <strong>diverse biomes</strong>. From\u00a0lush forests to ashen\u00a0wastes and snow covered cliffs.\u00a0Uncover secrets, discover ancient landmarks, and unlock new species along the way.\u00a0Each region tells\u00a0its own story, and every step brings you closer to reclaiming the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/6ef85795ca4f6008c2c7cd8f4a94e9c6.avif?t=1753477152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/cadee757bbe83994fd5e13283010fee0.poster.avif?t=1753477152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/cadee757bbe83994fd5e13283010fee0.webm?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/cadee757bbe83994fd5e13283010fee0.mp4?t=1753477152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock mutations</strong> that suit your playstyle and sharpen your instincts with each victory,\u00a0while defeat returns you to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128810/extras/506cf160148ac709a5576a6b2ad9cf05.avif?t=1753477152\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>14 playable dinosaurs</strong>, from nimble scouts to towering juggernauts, each with a playstyle defined by size, power, and mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>13 mutations</strong> that let you evolve, specialize, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 open-world maps</strong>, each with unique biomes and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focused <strong>one on one combat</strong> inspired by Souls-like design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite progression</strong>\u00a0with\u00a0single-run challenges and\u00a0permanent impact across journeys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Landmarks</strong>, Relics, and Echoes that reward exploration with meaningful discoveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Totems and Trophies</strong>,\u00a0unlockable rewards that reveal deeper insights into the world.</p></li></ul>",
